Subject: Bump cql module snappy-java and commons-lang3 for CVE remediation
Description: Stargate v1.0 cql/pom.xml declares org.xerial.snappy snappy-java and
  org.apache.commons commons-lang3 with inline versions that parent
  dependencyManagement cannot override, so the coordinator mvn/patch JSON alone
  does not replace the jars bundled into the cql module artifact.
Origin: DHI-internal (stargate CVE remediation)
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/stargate/stargate e2f006333b93235bf2c3526e1c396980e1cafb1b cql/pom.xml
Regenerate: `git clone --depth 1 --branch v1.0.91 https://github.com/stargate/stargate.git /tmp/stargate-cql-pom && cd /tmp/stargate-cql-pom/coordinator && sed -i 's|<version>1.1.7.6</version>|<version>1.1.10.9</version>|' cql/pom.xml && sed -i 's|<version>3.12.0</version>|<version>3.18.0</version>|' cql/pom.xml && git diff -- cql/pom.xml`
Forwarded: not-needed (inline Maven pins for Stargate v1.0.x until upstream bumps cql/pom.xml)
Drop-When: dependency org.xerial.snappy:snappy-java >= 1.1.10.9 (and org.apache.commons:commons-lang3 >= 3.18.0)

--- a/cql/pom.xml
+++ b/cql/pom.xml
@@ -74,7 +74,7 @@
     <dependency>
       <groupId>org.xerial.snappy</groupId>
       <artifactId>snappy-java</artifactId>
-      <version>1.1.7.6</version>
+      <version>1.1.10.9</version>
     </dependency>
     <dependency>
       <groupId>net.jpountz.lz4</groupId>
@@ -89,7 +89,7 @@
     <dependency>
       <groupId>org.apache.commons</groupId>
       <artifactId>commons-lang3</artifactId>
-      <version>3.12.0</version>
+      <version>3.18.0</version>
     </dependency>
     <dependency>
       <groupId>com.fasterxml.jackson.dataformat</groupId>
